  speakerName: {fileID: 0}
  icon: {fileID: 0}
  portugueseText: "Mas por algum motivo, Marco e Rafael se imaginavam vivendo em
    um mundo ut\xF3pico onde essa ditadura n\xE3o existia, e a vis\xE3o que ambos
    tiveram os fez na verdade despertar dessa ilus\xE3o, e enxergar o mundo real
    novamente. Os irm\xE3os v\xE3o atr\xE1s de seus pais que est\xE3o escondidos
    no jornal, tentando encontr\xE1-los antes dos militares."
  englishText: But for some reason, Marco and Rafael imagined themselves living in
    a utopian world where this dictatorship didn't exist, and the vision they both
    had actually awakened them from this illusion and allowed them to see the real
    world again. The brothers go in search of their parents, who are hidden in the
    newspaper, trying to find them before the military.
